Is a multi-player version of Nethack available in the near-future? It seems
the next logical progression of Nethack would be multi-user interaction
much like that of MUD (Multi-User Dungeon). 

Of course, this would require a rather major rewrite. Purist Nethackers
would no doubt object. The computing requirements may press hard on certain
CPUs...  But it can't be that tough, can it? How about a modem link for
two personal computers?

Hmm, on the subject of major improvements, how about adding a party of
adventurers for you to control? With the ability to find more NPC adventurers
willing to JOIN your party (a la Ultima and Bard's Tale).

Well, forgive this relatively new Nethacker if these suggestions have been
(no doubt) brought up before. Even if these suggestions are never made,
Nethack will still bring quite a bit of fun.

